      "final_assessment": "The candidate keeps it separately voiced and typed within the same numbered count-explanation account. The distinct actors and later reception event remain explicit, so a common source-report family does not turn it into Prophet speech or an invented additional canonical occurrence. Both masks/types are accepted unchanged.",
